(format-string leaves, batch A - docs/ledger/input-output.md, kinds
 430-440. Each leaf is called directly off a pinned rng seed and its
 emitted source printed in full, so the golden is the generated Vox
 itself, the same convention tests/471_gen_process_c.vox uses; several
 seeds per leaf so the drawn specifiers, widths, sinks and branches show
 up in the golden. The scratch-gated leaves need gen_scratch_flag and
 gen_does_file_io set by hand.)

Set gen_scratch_flag to "'the workspace'".
Set gen_does_file_io to true.
'rng seed' of 7.
'gen reset value names'.

Print "--- FMT-07, 08, 24, 32, 33, 38, 39: one format string in every sink ---".
'rng seed' of 11.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf format sinks agree' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, another seed ---".
'rng seed' of 12.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf format sinks agree' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, another seed ---".
'rng seed' of 13.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf format sinks agree' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, another seed ---".
'rng seed' of 14.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf format sinks agree' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- FMT-31, 34: format strings as paths ---".
'rng seed' of 21.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf format path sink' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, another seed ---".
'rng seed' of 22.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf format path sink' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, another seed ---".
'rng seed' of 23.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf format path sink' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- FMT-35: format strings in a treating clause ---".
'rng seed' of 31.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf format treating sink' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, another seed ---".
'rng seed' of 32.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf format treating sink' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, another seed ---".
'rng seed' of 33.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf format treating sink' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- FMT-21, 37: special names agree across sinks ---".
'rng seed' of 41.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf format special names agree' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, another seed ---".
'rng seed' of 42.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf format special names agree' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- FMT-36: format strings as function arguments ---".
'rng seed' of 51.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf format function argument' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, another seed ---".
'rng seed' of 52.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf format function argument' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, another seed ---".
'rng seed' of 53.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf format function argument' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- FMT-13 to 17: the radix specifiers ---".
'rng seed' of 61.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf format radix verified' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, another seed ---".
'rng seed' of 62.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf format radix verified' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, another seed ---".
